# Consultation Autosave & Draft Recovery

Apply when implementing or changing Doctor Consultation draft/autosave behavior.

## Stack to Reuse

- Vite + React, React Hook Form, TanStack Query
- Existing local persistence (`src/db/persistence.ts`) or IndexedDB for unsynced drafts
- This project is an **offline demo** — persist drafts locally only; do not call a remote API

## Requirements

- Autosave **3 seconds** after the user stops typing (debounce).
- Persist only changed fields in local storage / IndexedDB.
- Show accurate save status (saving, saved, offline).
- Restore the draft after refresh or failure.
- **Never** auto-submit or auto-sign the note.
- Explicit **Review and Sign** action only.
- Add unit tests; reuse shared infrastructure.
